        },
        "quote": "The Utilities Director shall designate the disposal facility to receive permitted hauled liquid waste. Disposal of hauled liquid waste at any location or site other than the designated disposal facility is prohibited. The Utilities Director also shall designate the hours of operation of the disposal facility and establish procedures by which the disposal facility may be used. Disposal of hauled liquid waste at any other time than the designated hours of operation or in violation of the established procedures of usage is prohibited.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.600:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.600 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "9e3686e8-8a30-59d0-978b-bdf059d7040b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1008,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.600:block:1",
          "start": 538
        },
        "quote": "The disposal charge for hauled liquid waste shall be calculated at a rate adjusted to the current documented waste strength. The disposal charge will be evaluated every two years thereafter and adjusted, if necessary, to reflect changes in the excess strength commercial rate charge, the current documented waste strength, and the WPCD’s percent of expenses related to treatment of the liquid waste. Such charge will be billed by the WPCD and payable on a monthly basis.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.600:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.600 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "5678e9a0-eaed-5f18-bee7-624383f2f392",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1230,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.600:block:2",
          "start": 1009
        },
        "quote": "Each liquid waste load which is presented for discharge shall require the submission of a load manifest on the electronic form available on the City of Topeka’s utilities web page which contains the following information:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.600:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.600 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "52fdd8bc-9e83-5c71-abbb-8ffd6ea85d10",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1328,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.600:block:3",
          "start": 1231
        },
        "quote": "(a) Certification statement, date, hauler’s first and last name, business name and email address.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.600:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
