        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "59ca83a8-4959-5d89-91f9-6adf46f537b8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1808,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.600:block:7",
          "start": 1475
        },
        "quote": "A manifest shall be prepared for each location where the hauler receives liquid waste. Failure to provide the manifest electronically to the WPCD for each load shall be cause to deny access to the designated disposal facility. Manifest records shall be maintained by the hauler for a period of three years. (Ord. 20157 § 3, 12-4-18.)",
